    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511970/extras/bbbe297d700ca7c0a917a69b2bc60d9b.poster.avif?t=1755412543\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511970/extras/bbbe297d700ca7c0a917a69b2bc60d9b.webm?t=1755412543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511970/extras/bbbe297d700ca7c0a917a69b2bc60d9b.mp4?t=1755412543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bubble Dome: Pop to the Top!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubble Dome: Pop to the Top! is a local-multiplayer arena shooter/brawler where players inside of a fish-mechs try to eliminate each other. Charge up and shoot bubbles, jump, evade, and knock your friends out to be the last fish standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f0 Small, procedurallay generated levels to knock your friends out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1f Charming and colorful fish-mechs to control!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play with up to 8 players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udee7 Bubble turrets to add chaos to the fun!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Attention: This game is digestible\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\ude0b\ud83c\udf74</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We're <strong>TENSTACK!</strong> A small collective of game makers creating lots of creative and 'digestible' games. A digestible game respects its players' money and time, is designed around a single idea, and doesn\u2019t overstay its welcome. We want you to be able to finish our games in just a couple of sessions\u2014without ever making you feel stuffed, so to say.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511970/extras/bbbe297d700ca7c0a917a69b2bc60d9b.poster.avif?t=1755412543\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511970/extras/bbbe297d700ca7c0a917a69b2bc60d9b.webm?t=1755412543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511970/extras/bbbe297d700ca7c0a917a69b2bc60d9b.mp4?t=1755412543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bubble Dome: Pop to the Top!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubble Dome: Pop to the Top! is a local-multiplayer arena shooter/brawler where players inside of a fish-mechs try to eliminate each other. Charge up and shoot bubbles, jump, evade, and knock your friends out to be the last fish standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f0 Small, procedurallay generated levels to knock your friends out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1f Charming and colorful fish-mechs to control!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play with up to 8 players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udee7 Bubble turrets to add chaos to the fun!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Attention: This game is digestible\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\ude0b\ud83c\udf74</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We're <strong>TENSTACK!</strong> A small collective of game makers creating lots of creative and 'digestible' games. A digestible game respects its players' money and time, is designed around a single idea, and doesn\u2019t overstay its welcome. We want you to be able to finish our games in just a couple of sessions\u2014without ever making you feel stuffed, so to say.</i></p>",
